<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/conflicts/19th-century">Conflicts &amp; Resolutions</a> · War</p><h1 class="enc-title">Austro-Prussian War</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1866">1866</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/19th-century">19th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Austro-Prussian War was a short war fought in 1866 between the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/austrian-empire">Austrian Empire</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kingdom-of-prussia">Prussia</a>, with their allies, for leadership in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/germany">Germany</a>. Prussia won decisively at the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-koniggratz">Battle of Königgrätz</a>. <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/austria">Austria</a> was excluded from German affairs, and the defeat led directly to the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/austro-hungarian-compromise-of-1867">Compromise of 1867</a> and the creation of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/austro-hungarian-empire">Austro-Hungarian Empire</a>.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/austro-prussian-war.jpg" alt="Austro-Prussian War" width="320" height="157" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Georg Bleibtreu · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Schlacht-bei-koeniggraetz-von-georg-bleibtreu.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
